   ❯❯❱ authlib - CVE-2026-28498
          Severity: HIGH                                                                                    
          Affected versions of authlib are vulnerable to Improper Following of Specification by Caller /    
          Improper Validation of Integrity Check Value. Authlib's OIDC ID Token validation can be bypassed  
          because `_verify_hash` (used to validate the `at_hash` and `c_hash` claims) fails open: if the ID 
